      },
      "score": 0.9094588756561279,
      "title": "Figure 5: A human-in-the-loop behavior correction example with ReAct in AlfWorld. (a) ReAct trajectory fails due to a hallucinating thought (Act 17). (b) By a human simply editing two thoughts (Act 17, 23), the ReAct trajectory produces desirable reasoning traces and actions and succeeds.",
      "layoutRegionId": "95c272da-5b9f-4cbb-93d7-c590d0c78914"
